WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.800
I'm 80 years old, and I suffered from migraines for many years.

2
00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:11.500
I had migraines, and nothing helped me.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
So I tried magnetic therapy, and it helped me.

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:25.200
Since then I've never had the pain, and I feel very, very good.
